WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.421 --> 00:00:03.060
Unit three. My Family Tree!

2
00:00:04.044 --> 00:00:09.686
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English!

3
00:00:09.736 --> 00:00:13.167
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.217 --> 00:00:16.694
Today we learn: My Family Tree. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.629 --> 00:00:21.062
Relative. Say it with me. Relative!

6
00:00:24.539 --> 00:00:27.739
Sibling. Say it with me. Sibling!

7
00:00:31.249 --> 00:00:35.399
Ancestor. Say it with me. Ancestor!

8
00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:42.657
Generation. Say it with me. Generation!

9
00:00:46.107 --> 00:00:49.723
Household. Say it with me. Household!

10
00:00:53.184 --> 00:00:57.367
Close-knit. Say it with me. Close-knit!

11
00:01:00.917 --> 00:01:05.651
Extended family. Say it with me. Extended family!

12
00:01:09.111 --> 00:01:13.211
Only child. Say it with me. Only child!

13
00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:19.609
Twin. Say it with me. Twin!

14
00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:26.783
Resemble. Say it with me. Resemble!

15
00:01:30.286 --> 00:01:33.720
Raise. Say it with me. Raise!

16
00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:40.343
Bond. Say it with me. Bond!

17
00:01:43.808 --> 00:01:53.468
Grammar time! Possessive pronouns. Listen. This is mine. That house is theirs.

18
00:01:53.518 --> 00:01:59.261
Your turn. Say it with me. This is mine. That house is theirs.

19
00:02:03.866 --> 00:02:10.658
I come from a close-knit extended family. I have one sibling, and we resemble our grandparents a lot.

20
00:02:10.708 --> 00:02:12.200
I like this story!

21
00:02:13.492 --> 00:02:18.787
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:18.837 --> 00:02:19.987
Ancestor!

23
00:02:21.104 --> 00:02:26.114
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:26.164 --> 00:02:27.580
Extended family!

25
00:02:28.749 --> 00:02:37.435
Think and answer. Describe one relative you are close to.

26
00:02:37.485 --> 00:02:38.789
Great answer!

27
00:02:39.885 --> 00:02:44.855
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

28
00:02:44.905 --> 00:02:46.724
Bye-bye, friends!

